sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant SDK as Trusted SDK controller
    participant Model as OpenAI model
    participant Gateway as Pilot policy and capture
    participant Docker as Disposable Docker sandbox
    participant Oracle as Independent host validator
    participant Files as Private run artifacts
    participant Check as Offline regression checker
    Operator->>SDK: Start bounded fictional invoice pilot
    SDK->>Model: Coder task and narrow tool schema
    Model-->>SDK: calculate_invoices(program)
    SDK->>Gateway: Actual role and SDK call ID
    Gateway->>Gateway: Check actor, exact capability, time and action state
    Gateway->>Docker: Python and fictional CSV without credentials or host files
    Docker-->>Gateway: Exit status and bounded process output
    Gateway->>Docker: Separate UID collects bounded regular result/input files
    Docker-->>Gateway: Actual artifact bytes
    Gateway->>Docker: Freeze then forcibly remove sandbox
    Gateway->>Files: Code, execution controls, receipts and output hash
    SDK->>Model: Successful execution receipt
    Model-->>SDK: delegate_to_verifier
    SDK->>Gateway: Observed handoff and narrower verifier grant
    SDK->>Model: Verifier task
    Model-->>SDK: validate_results()
    SDK->>Gateway: Check verifier authority before reading output
    Gateway->>Oracle: Actual bytes, frozen hash and withheld expected integers
    Oracle-->>Gateway: Exact result validation
    Gateway->>Files: Validation, manifest and completed investigation.json
    SDK->>Check: Check the completed case
    Check->>Files: Read the baseline pin and both investigation exports
    Check->>Files: Write review-package.json with matching evidence
    Check-->>SDK: Verdict and evidence references
    SDK->>Files: Save regression.json beside the invoice result
    Files-->>Operator: Import the review package locally
